and shuttered wholesalers below the back of the hill. One
light on the whole block: SUDS 24 HR COIN LAUNDRY, fluorescent,
with a row of washers along one wall and a row of dryers along
the other and a bench down the middle bolted to the floor.
One dryer is going round with nothing in it.

